{"version":1,"content":"<p>【比 Apple 還早 😂】沒想到吧，Apple iPhone Duo 還沒出，北韓品牌「馬頭山」在 9 月就推出了首款摺疊屏幕手機，近日在網絡上曝光的影片顯示，該機採用目前主流的左右內摺設計，並搭載經北韓官方深度修改與嚴格管制的 Android 作業系統，只能用北韓自家的 4G 網絡、不能連接 Wi-Fi，依然維持滴水不漏的監管機制。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:00:03.308281+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:50:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.787456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:08.976541+00:00","content_hash":"9ea37e45ac80e1b537800608d84cda5505cbe5963c37cc400d4eeb0128e4be20","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}